<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts sold mostly steady. Demand was moderate to light. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 49.00-50.00, few 50.50.</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 39.50-42.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 41.50-44.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 44.50-47.00</p>
</text>
